=== bridge ===
USAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  bridge [ OPTIONS ] OBJECT { COMMAND | help }
  bridge [ -force ] -batch filename


POSITIONALS (1) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  COMMAND


FLAGS (9) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    -V[ersion]
    -s[tatistics]
    -d[etails]
    -o[neline]
    -t[imestamp]
    -n[etns] name
    -c[ompressvlans]  -color -p[retty] -j[son] }
    -force
    -batch

=== bridge link ===

=== bridge fdb ===
USAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  bridge fdb { add | append | del | replace } ADDR dev DEV [ self ] [ master
      ] [ use ] [ router ] [ extern_learn ] [ sticky ] [ local | static |
      dynamic ] [ vlan VID ] { [ dst IPADDR ] [ port PORT] [ vni VNI ] | [
      nhid NHID ] } [ via DEV ] [ src_vni VNI ]
  bridge fdb [ show [ br BRDEV ] [ brport DEV ] [ vlan VID ] [ state STATE ]
      [ dynamic ] ]
  bridge fdb get [ to ] LLADDR [ br BRDEV ] { brport | dev } DEV [ vlan VID
      ] [ vni VNI ] [ self ] [ master ] [ dynamic ]
  bridge fdb flush dev DEV [ brport DEV ] [ vlan VID ] [ self ] [ master ] [
      [no]permanent | [no]static | [no]dynamic ] [ [no]added_by_user ] [
      [no]extern_learn ] [ [no]sticky ] [ [no]offloaded ]

